SUMMARY:America $2.50 – A Mettlesome Sketch Comedy Show
DESCRIPTION:Buckle up for a road trip across a great nation…that sometimes feels like it’s worth about two bucks and fifty cents. \nJoin us July 16th\, 17th\, 18th\, 23rd\, 24th\, and 25th. All shows at 7:30pm! \nHead Writer & Director: SNL’s Bryan Tucker \nFeaturing: Amelia Crabtree\, Zannie Gunn\, Shane Smith\, Sierra Smith\, Molly Williams\, Eden Yaacobi\, Tristan Yonce\, Marcus Zollicoffer \nWritten by: Emily Armond\, Adam Bakst\, Kevin Delgado\, Daniel Duncan\, Zannie Gunn\, Megan Myers\, Kara Phelps\, Shane Smith\, Sierra Smith\, and Eden Yaacobi. \nTechnical Director: Daniel Duncan. \nProduced by: Jack Reitz
