SUMMARY:Durham Disability Pride Parade
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 4th annual Durham Disability Pride event and parade! It will be taking place at Duke Memorial United Methodist Church from 3:00 pm to 6:30 pm with the parade starting at 5:30 pm. This year we will have art vendors\, resource tables\, live music\, speakers\, poster making\, beverages\, community building and so much more for you to enjoy! A sensory room will be available onsite to any who may need it. Keep an eye out for our instagram stories and highlights where updates on the event may be found as they come\, including parking\, venue\, and parade maps\, and amazing sponsors\, vendors\, speakers\, and performers who will be joining us for the event! Interested in volunteering\, having a table\, or being a part of our event in any way? Send us a message and we can point you in the right direction. Hope to see you there! #durhamdisabilitypride
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/durham-disability-pride-parade/
LOCATION:Duke Memorial United Methodist Church\, 504 West Chapel Hill Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Accessible,Annual,Causes,Community Engagement,Diversity & Inclusivity,Free,Parade,Walk
